{"description":"We’re a four-person team from Palestine taking on Field Shift. We’re using NASA climate data and local agricultural information to help farmers in Tulkarm compare four crop rotation plans based on water needs, soil protection, and potential income. We’re interested in Python, data analysis, web design, and AI automation. We’d welcome teammates with skills in agronomy, GIS, or satellite data who want to build a practical tool for local farmers.","image":null,"summary":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yPC1FDHvw7jDCJdhW2tRl5aZMMIvyRx3/view?usp=drive_link","details":"<p>https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qIbDf15FFa8yjzVvmo65cdJhkYmn8UtQ/view?usp=drive_link</p>","dataRefs":[["SMAP","https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/platforms/space-based-platforms/smap"],["NASA POWER","https://power.larc.nasa.gov/"],["SRTM","https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/instruments/srtm"],["LAND SET","https://earthexplorer.usgs.gov/"]],"projectRefs":[["External Data/Tools","https://drive.google.com/file/d/10cuSH06O25LkLmVoO9KkTEfyB9zmAGU3/view?usp=drive_link"]],"members":[{"name":"Sadeel Qashoa","country":"Palestinian Territories","avatar":null,"owner":true},{"name":"Ahmad Zaid Tomeh","country":"Palestinian Territories","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG-20260625-WA0066.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Mahmoud Abo Khader","country":"Palestinian Territories","avatar":null,"owner":false},{"name":"Lamar Rame faisal Mousa","country":"Palestinian Territories","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/swr-khlfyt-yfwn-bjwdh-lyh-khlfyt-y-1.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false}]}